1
00:00:14,688 --> 00:00:18,836
La vie en France est belle, tu ne trouves pas ?
Life in France is beautiful, don't you think?

2
00:00:18,936 --> 00:00:25,772
Oui ! Je ressens de la joie, mais je suis un peu fatiguée aujourd'hui.
Yes! I feel joy, but I'm a little tired today.

3
00:00:25,872 --> 00:00:30,716
Tu as un problème ? Tu sembles inquiète.
Do you have a problem? You seem worried.

4
00:00:30,816 --> 00:00:37,604
Ma mémoire me joue des tours : j'ai oublié mon rendez-vous. Quelle honte !
My memory is playing tricks on me: I forgot my appointment. How embarrassing!

5
00:00:37,704 --> 00:00:42,740
Ce n'est pas grave ; tu as de la chance, il est encore temps.
It's okay; you're in luck, there's still time.

6
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:47,396
Oui, l'amour de mes amis me donne du courage.
Yes, the love of my friends gives me courage.

7
00:00:47,496 --> 00:00:52,652
La vérité, c'est que la liberté et la joie sont importantes.
The truth is that freedom and joy are important.

8
00:00:52,752 --> 00:00:57,332
C'est vrai. Allons-y ensemble !
That's true. Let's go together!
